(19, 7, 'en', '<p>Located in the continent of Central America, Costa Rica covers 51,060 square kilometers of land and 40 square kilometers of water, making it the 131st largest nation in the world with a total area of 51,100 square kilometers.</p>', '<p>“Sunset Del Mar” is Spanish for “ocean sunset.” We chose this name because you’ll see one of the most beautiful sunsets in the world right here in Costa Rica, sitting on the serene Esterillos Beach, looking out over the Pacific Ocean extending to the horizon.</p>\r\n<p>When you visit us, chances are you will fall in love with the area, just like our owner did when he originally visited. He had travelled all over the world (including other tropical areas), but experienced something special here on the central west coast of Costa Rica, near the surf town of Jaco.</p>', '<p>Small Business Owner</p>', '<p>will help small business owner prepare for  upcoming Titanium Mastermind trip.</p>', '', '<p>MOBE currently has several upcoming Titanium Masterminds scheduled that will be taking place at the Sunset Del Mar Resort in Esterillos Este, Costa Rica.</p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p>Join us for this exclusive event where you will learn how to scale your business to 7-figures (and beyond) by implementing systems and “next level” marketing.</p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p>We’ll be covering a lot of ground at the Titanium Mastermind, but we can’t cover everything about marketing in 3 days. That’s why we’ve added five additional 3-day Summits on Traffic, Conversion, Leverage, Sales and Joint Ventures.</p>', '', '', '', ''),
(20, 7, 'es', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(21, 7, 'de', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '');
