(5, 2, 'en', 'Diamond Mastermind Event', '<p>An All-Inclusive 10-Day &amp; 11-Night Business Building Retreat in Paradise</p>', '<p>The Diamond Mastermind is an all-expense paid 10-day, 11-night event with all lodging, food, and entertainment included with the cost of your investment for you and a guest. Learn from some of the smartest minds on the planet when it comes to long-term business planning, product creation and get complimentary access to four additional 3-day summits to grow your business.</p>'),
