(4, 1, 'Luxury', '', 'Luxury', 3, 4, 2, 2, '190.00', '80.00', 0, '0.00', '0.00', '0.00', 0, '0.00', '0.00', '0.00', 0, '0.00', 1, 2, 2, '60.0', 'a:12:{i:0;s:1:"4";i:1;s:1:"7";i:2;s:1:"9";i:3;s:2:"10";i:4;s:2:"11";i:5;s:2:"12";i:6;s:2:"13";i:7;s:2:"15";i:8;s:2:"16";i:9;s:2:"17";i:10;s:2:"18";i:11;s:2:"19";}', 'luxury_icon.png', 'luxury_icon_thumb.jpg', 'luxury_1.jpg', 'luxury_1_thumb.jpg', 'luxury_2.jpg', 'luxury_2_thumb.jpg', 'luxury_3.jpg', 'luxury_3_thumb.jpg', '', '', '', '', 4, 5975, 1),
(5, 2, 'Standard Room', '<p>Relax in our standard room, complete with two queen size beds, customized furniture, gel-infused pillow top mattresses topped with luxurious duvets and duvet covers clean for every guest.</p>', '<p>Relax in our standard room, complete with two queen size beds, customized furniture, gel-infused pillow top mattresses topped with luxurious duvets and duvet covers clean for every guest, flat screen TV, mini-fridge, executive desk, wireless internet, all tastefully decorated with climate control at your fingertips. Exercise in our state of the art fitness facility, swim in our heated indoor swimming pool or relax in our sauna, all free of cost for our guests.</p>', 12, 2, 1, 0, '78.00', '50.00', 0, '0.00', '0.00', '0.00', 0, '0.00', '0.00', '0.00', 0, '0.00', 1, 1, 1, '44.0', 'a:9:{i:0;s:1:"4";i:1;s:2:"11";i:2;s:2:"12";i:3;s:2:"13";i:4;s:2:"14";i:5;s:2:"15";i:6;s:2:"16";i:7;s:2:"17";i:8;s:2:"18";}', '2_icon_j0yw8qxw4lgugfz1v8zk.jpg', '2_icon_j0yw8qxw4lgugfz1v8zk_thumb.jpg', '2_view1_tusig7ybnia1s9xzyvw3.jpg', '2_view1_tusig7ybnia1s9xzyvw3_thumb.jpg', '2_view2_ldxwsxwn6v8vq1e77dht.jpg', '2_view2_ldxwsxwn6v8vq1e77dht_thumb.jpg', '', '', '', '', '', '', 0, 12349, 1),
(6, 2, 'Double Room with Two Double Beds', '<p>A standard hotel room is an elongated hotel room designed for two people, though some standard doubles can accommodate up to four. The standard double hotel room is available at many full-service hotels, with the exclusion of facilities that house only suites or extended-stay guests.</p>', '<p>A standard hotel room is an elongated hotel room designed for two people, though some standard doubles can accommodate up to four. The standard double hotel room is available at many full-service hotels, with the exclusion of facilities that house only suites or extended-stay guests. The standard double room is ideal for a brief stay of up to a few days. It doesn''t contain a kitchen, so guests can''t cook their own meals.</p>', 10, 4, 1, 1, '119.00', '80.00', 0, '0.00', '0.00', '0.00', 0, '0.00', '0.00', '0.00', 0, '0.00', 1, 2, 2, '90.0', 'a:11:{i:0;s:1:"2";i:1;s:1:"4";i:2;s:1:"5";i:3;s:1:"9";i:4;s:2:"12";i:5;s:2:"15";i:6;s:2:"18";i:7;s:2:"19";i:8;s:2:"21";i:9;s:2:"23";i:10;s:2:"24";}', '2_icon_n7bisjedxa1pntimfdnq.jpg', '2_icon_n7bisjedxa1pntimfdnq_thumb.jpg', '2_view1_dlcv6g4vvq5exgwp1b4x.jpg', '2_view1_dlcv6g4vvq5exgwp1b4x_thumb.jpg', '2_view2_upvdxolmdb8edlp8wl7b.jpg', '2_view2_upvdxolmdb8edlp8wl7b_thumb.jpg', '', '', '', '', '', '', 1, 11333, 1),
(7, 3, 'Junior Suite', '<p>Our spacious Junior hotel Suites are 460 square feet (43 square meters) featuring floor-to-ceiling windows overlooking Manhattan from our New York City hotel suites. Junior Suites offer luxurious king beds, 55-inch flat-panel HDTV with Blu-ray player and iPod docking station, marble baths, and a large walk-in closet.</p>', '<p>Our spacious Junior hotel Suites are 460 square feet (43 square meters) featuring floor-to-ceiling windows overlooking Manhattan from our New York City hotel suites. Junior Suites offer luxurious king beds, 55-inch flat-panel HDTV with Blu-ray player and iPod docking station, marble baths, and a large walk-in closet.<br /> For your comfort and convenience, most also include a fully equipped European-style kitchen with appliances by Sub-Zero, and a sitting area with a twin-size sofa bed. All of our New York hotel guests enjoy full access to our health club and spa.</p>', 5, 1, 1, 0, '75.00', '45.00', 0, '0.00', '0.00', '0.00', 0, '0.00', '0.00', '0.00', 0, '0.00', 1, 1, 1, '99.0', 'a:11:{i:0;s:1:"3";i:1;s:1:"4";i:2;s:1:"5";i:3;s:1:"6";i:4;s:1:"7";i:5;s:1:"8";i:6;s:1:"9";i:7;s:2:"10";i:8;s:2:"11";i:9;s:2:"12";i:10;s:2:"14";}', '3_icon_ddgadcswt83f03qun4px.jpg', '3_icon_ddgadcswt83f03qun4px_thumb.jpg', '3_view1_b5gft5x6tryforoj0uhe.jpg', '3_view1_b5gft5x6tryforoj0uhe_thumb.jpg', '3_view2_r7ktge71lpyv0aitol13.jpg', '3_view2_r7ktge71lpyv0aitol13_thumb.jpg', '3_view3_xrc4yfscghg6n1y5f652.jpg', '3_view3_xrc4yfscghg6n1y5f652_thumb.jpg', '3_view4_ocqs8rqg8z704mpxrm3k.jpg', '3_view4_ocqs8rqg8z704mpxrm3k_thumb.jpg', '3_view5_j213sol3j3h3f8umyl47.jpg', '3_view5_j213sol3j3h3f8umyl47_thumb.jpg', 0, 3899, 1),
(8, 3, 'Executive Double Room', '<p>Stunning Executive Double bedrooms provide the perfect setting in the heart of London. Exclusive features you won’t find in Double Cumberland Guest rooms include luxurious bathrobes and slippers, complimentary mineral water and full access to the Guoman Club Lounge with complimentary newspapers and refreshments available all day.</p>', '<p>Stunning Executive Double bedrooms provide the perfect setting in the heart of London. Exclusive features you won’t find in Double Cumberland Guest rooms include luxurious bathrobes and slippers, complimentary mineral water and full access to the Guoman Club Lounge with complimentary newspapers and refreshments available all day.</p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p>As you would expect from Guoman, all our 50 Executive Double bedrooms also benefit from fast, complimentary BT Wi-fi and entertainment at your fingertips with a 32-inch LCD TV. You’ll appreciate extra space to unwind and recharge for the day ahead with beautifully designed bathrooms featuring walk-in power showers and mist-free mirrors. Welcome details that provide an oasis of calm in the centre of London.</p>', 12, 3, 1, 1, '109.00', '50.00', 0, '0.00', '0.00', '0.00', 0, '0.00', '0.00', '0.00', 0, '0.00', 1, 2, 2, '112.0', 'a:9:{i:0;s:1:"1";i:1;s:1:"5";i:2;s:1:"6";i:3;s:1:"8";i:4;s:1:"9";i:5;s:2:"10";i:6;s:2:"13";i:7;s:2:"15";i:8;s:2:"17";}', '3_icon_du43vsrg9nv5slkhgpbk.jpg', '3_icon_du43vsrg9nv5slkhgpbk_thumb.jpg', '3_view1_d7cwxzwjcaui6yk1qbgy.jpg', '3_view1_d7cwxzwjcaui6yk1qbgy_thumb.jpg', '3_view2_zc4sxn0ddlyiraep0b0m.jpg', '3_view2_zc4sxn0ddlyiraep0b0m_thumb.jpg', '', '', '', '', '', '', 2, 3931, 1),
(9, 4, 'Junior Suite', '<p>These comfortable suites are ideal for guests looking for a little extra space. Featuring sumptuous carpets and gold silk curtains throughout, the large living area has a three-seater sofa, choice of beautifully upholstered armchairs and a dark wood coffee table, making it the perfect space for working, entertaining or relaxing. The bedroom area is a private retreat with king beds and large windows. Fashioned from black and white marble, bathrooms feature chequered floors and abstract artwork.</p>', '<p>These comfortable suites are ideal for guests looking for a little extra space. Featuring sumptuous carpets and gold silk curtains throughout, the large living area has a three-seater sofa, choice of beautifully upholstered armchairs and a dark wood coffee table, making it the perfect space for working, entertaining or relaxing. The bedroom area is a private retreat with king beds and large windows. Fashioned from black and white marble, bathrooms feature chequered floors and abstract artwork.</p>', 5, 1, 0, 0, '55.00', '0.00', 0, '0.00', '0.00', '0.00', 0, '0.00', '0.00', '0.00', 0, '0.00', 1, 1, 1, '35.0', 'a:10:{i:0;s:1:"1";i:1;s:1:"2";i:2;s:1:"3";i:3;s:1:"5";i:4;s:1:"6";i:5;s:1:"7";i:6;s:2:"10";i:7;s:2:"12";i:8;s:2:"18";i:9;s:2:"22";}', '4_icon_pvy2617qjojbome2mdxe.jpg', '4_icon_pvy2617qjojbome2mdxe_thumb.jpg', '4_view1_iwx3zwtxh175w5626bro.jpg', '4_view1_iwx3zwtxh175w5626bro_thumb.jpg', '4_view2_zb1oxepksmy4jv7jr1g0.jpg', '4_view2_zb1oxepksmy4jv7jr1g0_thumb.jpg', '4_view3_zr2a5f03sxp4hioiykwh.jpg', '4_view3_zr2a5f03sxp4hioiykwh_thumb.jpg', '4_view4_ed6sfng65mf6v23gdjbv.jpg', '4_view4_ed6sfng65mf6v23gdjbv_thumb.jpg', '', '', 0, 4382, 1),
(10, 4, 'Super Deluxe', '<p>Our Superior Rooms feature a Double bed or 2 Single beds as required by our guests, we also offer zip and link beds.  The size of the room varies from 17 to 20 Sq. Meters.  Below is a list of room features and amenities that adorn the room to make your stay more enjoyable.</p>', '<p>Our Superior Rooms feature a Double bed or 2 Single beds as required by our guests, we also offer zip and link beds.  The size of the room varies from 17 to 20 Sq. Meters.  Below is a list of room features and amenities that adorn the room to make your stay more enjoyable.</p>', 12, 2, 1, 0, '99.00', '40.00', 0, '0.00', '0.00', '0.00', 0, '0.00', '0.00', '0.00', 0, '0.00', 1, 1, 1, '88.0', 'a:8:{i:0;s:1:"1";i:1;s:1:"2";i:2;s:1:"3";i:3;s:1:"8";i:4;s:2:"12";i:5;s:2:"14";i:6;s:2:"15";i:7;s:2:"18";}', '4_icon_lwvpee1h0m9yq7hiebmb.jpg', '4_icon_lwvpee1h0m9yq7hiebmb_thumb.jpg', '4_view1_kiy3yxj11onhkj7yx7g8.jpg', '4_view1_kiy3yxj11onhkj7yx7g8_thumb.jpg', '4_view2_vp7kvn3azpld8jg7gz7h.jpg', '4_view2_vp7kvn3azpld8jg7gz7h_thumb.jpg', '4_view3_ruz8d67bcnj7cpq9dtic.jpg', '4_view3_ruz8d67bcnj7cpq9dtic_thumb.jpg', '4_view4_n4qrn7x575muzl3dq0p3.jpg', '4_view4_n4qrn7x575muzl3dq0p3_thumb.jpg', '', '', 1, 4671, 1),
(11, 5, 'Standard Double Room', '<p>This room has a flat-screen satellite TV, air conditioning, coffee machine and a minibar. The private bathroom provides a hairdryer and bathrobes.  Room Facilities: Safe, Air conditioning, Desk, Heating, Soundproof, Hardwood/Parquet floors, Wardrobe/Closet, Hairdryer, Bathrobe, Free toiletries, Toilet, Bathroom, Slippers, Bathtub or etc.</p>', '<p>This room has a flat-screen satellite TV, air conditioning, coffee machine and a minibar. The private bathroom provides a hairdryer and bathrobes.  Room Facilities: Safe, Air conditioning, Desk, Heating, Soundproof, Hardwood/Parquet floors, Wardrobe/Closet, Hairdryer, Bathrobe, Free toiletries, Toilet, Bathroom, Slippers, Bathtub or shower, Telephone, Radio, Satellite channels, Laptop safe, Flat-screen TV, Minibar, Coffee machine, Wake-up service, Alarm clock, Towels, Linens  Free WiFi is available in all rooms.</p>', 9, 2, 1, 0, '88.00', '45.00', 0, '0.00', '0.00', '0.00', 0, '0.00', '0.00', '0.00', 0, '0.00', 1, 2, 1, '67.0', 'a:11:{i:0;s:1:"3";i:1;s:1:"4";i:2;s:1:"5";i:3;s:1:"6";i:4;s:1:"8";i:5;s:2:"11";i:6;s:2:"12";i:7;s:2:"14";i:8;s:2:"15";i:9;s:2:"18";i:10;s:2:"22";}', '5_icon_ekm4dx3jz28acmvve6ni.jpg', '5_icon_ekm4dx3jz28acmvve6ni_thumb.jpg', '5_view1_p9vuqbnhr69wqv15s3nr.jpg', '5_view1_p9vuqbnhr69wqv15s3nr_thumb.jpg', '5_view2_dv3hiydx41go0bjzm7ge.jpg', '5_view2_dv3hiydx41go0bjzm7ge_thumb.jpg', '5_view3_jpa4kb9dev6ir8106d80.jpg', '5_view3_jpa4kb9dev6ir8106d80_thumb.jpg', '5_view4_knynzhnmo512ub5emcr1.jpg', '5_view4_knynzhnmo512ub5emcr1_thumb.jpg', '', '', 0, 5529, 1),
(12, 5, 'Basic Double Room', '<p>xcellent for couples looking for cheap hotel accommodation when enjoying a romantic evening out in our city or an extended stay in the Capital. Located near Hackney, Islington and Shoreditch we are in a great location to access many popular attractions nearby.</p>', '<p>xcellent for couples looking for cheap hotel accommodation when enjoying a romantic evening out in our city or an extended stay in the Capital. Located near Hackney, Islington and Shoreditch we are in a great location to access many popular attractions nearby and our highly accessible transport options will get you into the heart of our city within minutes!</p>\r\n<p>Don''t forget to download and print your complimentary holiday packing list from the right-hand side!</p>', 17, 3, 0, 1, '92.00', '40.00', 0, '0.00', '0.00', '0.00', 0, '0.00', '0.00', '0.00', 0, '0.00', 1, 2, 1, '99.0', 'a:13:{i:0;s:1:"2";i:1;s:1:"3";i:2;s:1:"4";i:3;s:1:"5";i:4;s:1:"8";i:5;s:2:"10";i:6;s:2:"11";i:7;s:2:"12";i:8;s:2:"13";i:9;s:2:"14";i:10;s:2:"15";i:11;s:2:"16";i:12;s:2:"17";}', '5_icon_k6orsn9n9q4qwc3kqiez.jpg', '5_icon_k6orsn9n9q4qwc3kqiez_thumb.jpg', '5_view1_e4sovo9s12pe8d7z2fn0.jpg', '5_view1_e4sovo9s12pe8d7z2fn0_thumb.jpg', '5_view2_drz243muk1tr5lgzapsb.jpg', '5_view2_drz243muk1tr5lgzapsb_thumb.jpg', '5_view3_hqck6lek8gj6mggwyfh7.jpg', '5_view3_hqck6lek8gj6mggwyfh7_thumb.jpg', '5_view4_or2ztsjzcepl627bnlvu.jpg', '5_view4_or2ztsjzcepl627bnlvu_thumb.jpg', '5_view5_bfzowglvw42fv4eovyo8.jpg', '5_view5_bfzowglvw42fv4eovyo8_thumb.jpg', 1, 5581, 1),
(13, 6, 'Business Twin Room', '<p>he large windows in these generously spacious 26 square metre rooms  provide a sense of openness and executive charm. Designed with a sense  of exacting details to meet the combined productive and relaxation needs  of guests travelling on business.</p>', '<p>he large windows in these generously spacious 26 square metre rooms  provide a sense of openness and executive charm. Designed with a sense  of exacting details to meet the combined productive and relaxation needs  of guests travelling on business, each room is furnished with a large  desk and LAN access, and easy chairs to just unwind. The layout though  simple, exudes a sense of freshness and cleanliness.</p>', 19, 2, 1, 0, '88.00', '60.00', 0, '0.00', '0.00', '0.00', 0, '0.00', '0.00', '0.00', 0, '0.00', 1, 1, 1, '80.0', 'a:11:{i:0;s:1:"1";i:1;s:1:"3";i:2;s:1:"5";i:3;s:1:"7";i:4;s:1:"8";i:5;s:2:"10";i:6;s:2:"11";i:7;s:2:"12";i:8;s:2:"14";i:9;s:2:"15";i:10;s:2:"22";}', '6_icon_drwomc3y6c1pwe82xfxy.jpg', '6_icon_drwomc3y6c1pwe82xfxy_thumb.jpg', '6_view1_f00v2vflg4ilvfahscfx.jpg', '6_view1_f00v2vflg4ilvfahscfx_thumb.jpg', '6_view2_sgmmuunralqhu1dvvshc.jpg', '6_view2_sgmmuunralqhu1dvvshc_thumb.jpg', '6_view3_x1yrf998lo6b5sxynlqx.jpg', '6_view3_x1yrf998lo6b5sxynlqx_thumb.jpg', '6_view4_ehe2hswcleohem9uvh3h.jpg', '6_view4_ehe2hswcleohem9uvh3h_thumb.jpg', '', '', 0, 4360, 1),
(14, 6, 'Suite', '<p>A suite in a hotel or other public accommodation denotes a class of accommodations with more space than a typical hotel room.</p>', '<p>A suite in a hotel or other public accommodation denotes a class of accommodations with more space than a typical hotel room.  In luxury or upscale accommodations, such as Ritz Carlton, Marriott, or Embassy Suites, key features may include multiple rooms. Many independent properties have one or more honeymoon suites, and sometimes the best accommodation at a high-end hotel is called the presidential suite or royal suite.</p>', 1, 1, 1, 0, '66.00', '20.00', 0, '0.00', '0.00', '0.00', 0, '0.00', '0.00', '0.00', 0, '0.00', 1, 0, 0, '44.0', 'a:9:{i:0;s:1:"2";i:1;s:1:"3";i:2;s:1:"4";i:3;s:1:"5";i:4;s:2:"10";i:5;s:2:"11";i:6;s:2:"13";i:7;s:2:"18";i:8;s:2:"21";}', '6_icon_ivpctil0a80klmoi9zef.jpg', '6_icon_ivpctil0a80klmoi9zef_thumb.jpg', '6_view1_j9ipipj9gv3rrs4kapul.jpg', '6_view1_j9ipipj9gv3rrs4kapul_thumb.jpg', '6_view2_x46iqu1yufe8nww6mge4.jpg', '6_view2_x46iqu1yufe8nww6mge4_thumb.jpg', '6_view3_ihu40yojoi6llb4c65bz.jpg', '6_view3_ihu40yojoi6llb4c65bz_thumb.jpg', '6_view4_o4nbq16bek028zh3i50k.jpg', '6_view4_o4nbq16bek028zh3i50k_thumb.jpg', '', '', 2, 13515, 1),
(15, 7, 'Grand Sea View Room', '<p>Welcome to this contemporary room offering an amazing sea view, a balcony, work area and marble bathroom. Catch up on work at the desk or check your emails with complimentary internet access.</p>', '<p>Welcome to this contemporary room offering an amazing sea view, a balcony, work area and marble bathroom. Catch up on work at the desk or check your emails with complimentary internet access. Special touches include daily newspapers delivery upon request and welcome amenities.</p>', 5, 2, 0, 0, '87.00', '20.00', 0, '0.00', '0.00', '0.00', 0, '0.00', '0.00', '0.00', 0, '0.00', 1, 1, 1, '88.0', 'a:7:{i:0;s:1:"3";i:1;s:1:"5";i:2;s:1:"8";i:3;s:2:"10";i:4;s:2:"12";i:5;s:2:"15";i:6;s:2:"18";}', '7_icon_xfgcrzegbkzt2ipcjnx5.jpg', '7_icon_xfgcrzegbkzt2ipcjnx5_thumb.jpg', '7_view1_e7pzgd1tv83rnj5ejivu.jpg', '7_view1_e7pzgd1tv83rnj5ejivu_thumb.jpg', '7_view2_cun5ddgx1e27kr7268u1.jpg', '7_view2_cun5ddgx1e27kr7268u1_thumb.jpg', '7_view3_lws3fxhzgdtj8hnlu4iv.jpg', '7_view3_lws3fxhzgdtj8hnlu4iv_thumb.jpg', '', '', '', '', 0, 5857, 1),
(16, 7, 'Family studio sea view', '<p>Studios have a walk in Shower &amp; separate bathtub, king-size or twin beds, individually controlled air conditioning / heating, satellite TV with pay movies, complimentary WiFi &amp; broadband internet connection, safe, mini-bar, coffee &amp; tea making facilities, baby monitoring service via the telephone.</p>', '<p>Studios have a walk in Shower &amp; separate bathtub, king-size or twin beds, individually controlled air conditioning / heating, satellite TV with pay movies, complimentary WiFi &amp; broadband internet connection, safe, mini-bar, coffee &amp; tea making facilities, baby monitoring service via the telephone.</p>\r\n<p>All rooms have balcony (Beach Studios have either balcony or terrace) with one table and two chairs and boast panoramic views of the blue Mediterranean Sea.</p>', 12, 3, 1, 1, '92.00', '44.00', 0, '0.00', '0.00', '0.00', 0, '0.00', '0.00', '0.00', 0, '0.00', 1, 2, 1, '85.0', 'a:10:{i:0;s:1:"2";i:1;s:1:"4";i:2;s:1:"5";i:3;s:1:"6";i:4;s:2:"11";i:5;s:2:"12";i:6;s:2:"13";i:7;s:2:"14";i:8;s:2:"19";i:9;s:2:"21";}', '7_icon_yzzd3onb9wjq6ehjzzgv.jpg', '7_icon_yzzd3onb9wjq6ehjzzgv_thumb.jpg', '7_view1_zntjx7d2ccg0cfne5apd.jpg', '7_view1_zntjx7d2ccg0cfne5apd_thumb.jpg', '7_view2_f94cmlwmkchkzb4xihyu.jpg', '7_view2_f94cmlwmkchkzb4xihyu_thumb.jpg', '7_view3_vf57vrkz3ac0jfm72itl.jpg', '7_view3_vf57vrkz3ac0jfm72itl_thumb.jpg', '7_view4_wa6um9r5qpyk54qzubzx.jpg', '7_view4_wa6um9r5qpyk54qzubzx_thumb.jpg', '', '', 1, 12050, 1),
(17, 8, 'Superior Double Room', '<p>Classically beautiful and individually designed rooms from 20 sqm/215 sqf. All rooms contain a comfortable seating area and a modern workplace with a desk and comfy king-size bed. Some rooms have a fantastic waterfront view of the Royal Palace and Gasmla Stand, our old town.</p>', '<p>Sometimes you need a little more space. We offer a number of larger suites that can be expanded to up to five rooms by adding beautifully decorated parlours. The parlours come in two sizes – grand and grandiose.</p>\r\n<p>Classically beautiful and individually designed rooms from 20 sqm/215 sqf. All rooms contain a comfortable seating area and a modern workplace with a desk and comfy king-size bed. Some rooms have a fantastic waterfront view of the Royal Palace and Gasmla Stand, our old town.</p>', 15, 4, 1, 1, '95.00', '55.00', 0, '0.00', '0.00', '0.00', 0, '0.00', '0.00', '0.00', 0, '0.00', 1, 2, 2, '99.0', 'a:12:{i:0;s:1:"1";i:1;s:1:"2";i:2;s:1:"3";i:3;s:1:"4";i:4;s:1:"5";i:5;s:1:"6";i:6;s:1:"7";i:7;s:2:"12";i:8;s:2:"14";i:9;s:2:"15";i:10;s:2:"16";i:11;s:2:"17";}', '8_icon_l66eycpiz039zhbk1q9r.jpg', '8_icon_l66eycpiz039zhbk1q9r_thumb.jpg', '8_view1_k5m901ugwe7ckcriph1p.jpg', '8_view1_k5m901ugwe7ckcriph1p_thumb.jpg', '8_view2_t4xpk9akzjcdozmxzhev.jpg', '8_view2_t4xpk9akzjcdozmxzhev_thumb.jpg', '8_view3_xk9fxzymhzc830xni88h.jpg', '8_view3_xk9fxzymhzc830xni88h_thumb.jpg', '8_view4_tkvfjidizrevcnb0m0w5.jpg', '8_view4_tkvfjidizrevcnb0m0w5_thumb.jpg', '', '', 0, 14471, 1),
(18, 9, 'Family Room', '<p>Hotel offers several different types of family rooms. There are rooms with a double bed and a sofa bed for one person (80 cm) or two people (120 cm) and rooms with connecting doors so that several rooms can be linked for large families.</p>', '<p>Hotel offers several different types of family rooms. There are rooms with a double bed and a sofa bed for one person (80 cm) or two people (120 cm) and rooms with connecting doors so that several rooms can be linked for large families.</p>\r\n<p>All suites have a stunning waterfront view of the Royal Palace and Gamla Stan, Stockholm’s old town. The suites and parlours can be combined and fully tailored to meet your wishes and requirements. You can also hire an entire floor or two. Just get in touch and we’ll make the arrangements.</p>', 9, 3, 0, 0, '88.00', '0.00', 0, '0.00', '0.00', '0.00', 0, '0.00', '0.00', '0.00', 0, '0.00', 1, 1, 1, '77.0', 'a:9:{i:0;s:1:"1";i:1;s:1:"3";i:2;s:1:"6";i:3;s:2:"10";i:4;s:2:"11";i:5;s:2:"14";i:6;s:2:"16";i:7;s:2:"19";i:8;s:2:"25";}', '9_icon_tgwbvxqpdzmrbemf0ckq.jpg', '9_icon_tgwbvxqpdzmrbemf0ckq_thumb.jpg', '9_view1_svjv3mff7cjxtf0od1er.jpg', '9_view1_svjv3mff7cjxtf0od1er_thumb.jpg', '9_view2_z1ibf5rpgbg68z20mhps.jpg', '9_view2_z1ibf5rpgbg68z20mhps_thumb.jpg', '9_view3_v9qoo1c21qszraa8f2ww.jpg', '9_view3_v9qoo1c21qszraa8f2ww_thumb.jpg', '9_view4_jc3kc4uyljrfsi4gigii.jpg', '9_view4_jc3kc4uyljrfsi4gigii_thumb.jpg', '', '', 0, 5257, 1),
(19, 8, 'Comfort Double or Twin Room', '<p>Stay and relax in our modern and spacious double or twin room perfectly suited for business style. All the rooms have authentic and distinctive design, a comfortable king size or twin bed, armchairs with coffee table and an integral desk for ease of work.  The rooms are intended to accommodate one, maximum two persons.</p>', '<p>Stay and relax in our modern and spacious double or twin room perfectly suited for business style. All the rooms have authentic and distinctive design, a comfortable king size or twin bed, armchairs with coffee table and an integral desk for ease of work.  The rooms are intended to accommodate one, maximum two persons.</p>', 10, 2, 0, 0, '78.00', '0.00', 0, '0.00', '0.00', '0.00', 0, '0.00', '0.00', '0.00', 0, '0.00', 1, 0, 0, '69.0', 'a:9:{i:0;s:1:"2";i:1;s:1:"4";i:2;s:1:"5";i:3;s:1:"6";i:4;s:1:"8";i:5;s:2:"12";i:6;s:2:"14";i:7;s:2:"15";i:8;s:2:"19";}', '8_icon_e23dgxtp5amgix1pdggi.jpg', '8_icon_e23dgxtp5amgix1pdggi_thumb.jpg', '8_view1_ih9a5lvg0zfatzvoy5gq.jpg', '8_view1_ih9a5lvg0zfatzvoy5gq_thumb.jpg', '8_view2_f2h3szods0j4rrevdabm.jpg', '8_view2_f2h3szods0j4rrevdabm_thumb.jpg', '8_view3_hrw4rsrpw9g50x83wvfp.jpg', '8_view3_hrw4rsrpw9g50x83wvfp_thumb.jpg', '8_view4_az896oiis90xrf2cekhx.jpg', '8_view4_az896oiis90xrf2cekhx_thumb.jpg', '8_view5_r903jiyosxjtwr23fjk9.jpg', '8_view5_r903jiyosxjtwr23fjk9_thumb.jpg', 1, 13471, 1),
(20, 9, 'Junior Suite', '<p>Junior Suites are large open plan suites with a bedroom and a spacious sitting area separated by an archway. The suites have beautiful natural light and are available with King or Twin beds.  The room features include an interactive flat screen TV, large writing desk, in-room safe, marble en-suite bathroom with bathtub and shower.</p>', '<p>Junior Suites are large open plan suites with a bedroom and a spacious sitting area separated by an archway. The suites have beautiful natural light and are available with King or Twin beds.  The room features include an interactive flat screen TV, large writing desk, in-room safe, marble en-suite bathroom with bathtub and shower, Ren toiletries, bathrobes, slippers, self controlled air-conditioning unit and opening windows. We provide complimentary Wi-Fi and Water. All of our Suites have been newly refurbished in soothing pastille colours creating a relaxing luxurious space.  Can sleep up to 3 with an extra bed.</p>', 12, 2, 1, 0, '88.00', '40.00', 0, '0.00', '0.00', '0.00', 0, '0.00', '0.00', '0.00', 0, '0.00', 1, 1, 1, '70.0', 'a:10:{i:0;s:1:"1";i:1;s:1:"2";i:2;s:1:"3";i:3;s:1:"5";i:4;s:1:"7";i:5;s:1:"8";i:6;s:2:"10";i:7;s:2:"12";i:8;s:2:"13";i:9;s:2:"16";}', '9_icon_w7mtvqlf5kobqaap2wgj.jpg', '9_icon_w7mtvqlf5kobqaap2wgj_thumb.jpg', '9_view1_m9erd6cjfwdbqkfdllvb.jpg', '9_view1_m9erd6cjfwdbqkfdllvb_thumb.jpg', '9_view2_o973j0lnn1j59yvm497j.jpg', '9_view2_o973j0lnn1j59yvm497j_thumb.jpg', '9_view3_djvv5a0pw51gd8jxg5k4.jpg', '9_view3_djvv5a0pw51gd8jxg5k4_thumb.jpg', '9_view4_d48d3417b7pgqkcuulkq.jpg', '9_view4_d48d3417b7pgqkcuulkq_thumb.jpg', '', '', 1, 4486, 1),
(21, 10, 'Twin Room', '<p>Twin rooms can accommodate up to two people in adjacent twin beds (90cm wide). Our twin rooms overlook the courtyard, ensuring the utmost peace and quiet for our guests. All twin rooms have an en-suite bathroom with bath and toilet.</p>', '<p>Twin rooms can accommodate up to two people in adjacent twin beds (90cm wide). Our twin rooms overlook the courtyard, ensuring the utmost peace and quiet for our guests. All twin rooms have an en-suite bathroom with bath and toilet.</p>\r\n<p>It also features a large window, with black out shutters, and shared bathroom facilities . Linen and towels are included in the price. This room can only be booked for minimum of 2 persons.</p>', 14, 2, 1, 0, '67.00', '20.00', 0, '0.00', '0.00', '0.00', 0, '0.00', '0.00', '0.00', 0, '0.00', 1, 1, 1, '45.0', 'a:11:{i:0;s:1:"2";i:1;s:1:"3";i:2;s:1:"5";i:3;s:2:"10";i:4;s:2:"12";i:5;s:2:"13";i:6;s:2:"15";i:7;s:2:"16";i:8;s:2:"21";i:9;s:2:"22";i:10;s:2:"23";}', '10_icon_k7k5a7xitdbrofbd6ot5.jpg', '10_icon_k7k5a7xitdbrofbd6ot5_thumb.jpg', '10_view1_n8564yvmxqecxzg96dqz.jpg', '10_view1_n8564yvmxqecxzg96dqz_thumb.jpg', '10_view2_t3rei3snrls0sxfwvais.jpg', '10_view2_t3rei3snrls0sxfwvais_thumb.jpg', '10_view3_ax5yxk74yx4pzu5hxw6o.jpg', '10_view3_ax5yxk74yx4pzu5hxw6o_thumb.jpg', '10_view4_nyyavd8qopjpnook9uo8.jpg', '10_view4_nyyavd8qopjpnook9uo8_thumb.jpg', '10_view5_wxgyjrzeplkf3g74jyww.jpg', '10_view5_wxgyjrzeplkf3g74jyww_thumb.jpg', 0, 4398, 1),
(22, 10, 'Junior Suite', '<p>The Jr. Suite at the Sheraton Rhodes Resort. Enjoy spacious and welcoming living area, flat screen LCD 32” television, marble bathroom, private furnished balcony and your private coffee &amp; tea facilities: unique view over the Aegean Sea, living area,     sheraton Sweet Sleeper Bed (king size), branded bathroom amenities, bathrobes &amp; slippers.</p>', '<p>The Jr. Suite at the Sheraton Rhodes Resort. Enjoy spacious and welcoming living area, flat screen LCD 32” television, marble bathroom, private furnished balcony and your private coffee &amp; tea facilities: unique view over the Aegean Sea, living area,     sheraton Sweet Sleeper Bed (king size), branded bathroom amenities, bathrobes &amp; slippers.</p>', 19, 12, 0, 0, '65.00', '40.00', 0, '0.00', '0.00', '0.00', 0, '0.00', '0.00', '0.00', 0, '0.00', 1, 1, 1, '38.0', 'a:9:{i:0;s:1:"1";i:1;s:1:"2";i:2;s:1:"3";i:3;s:1:"5";i:4;s:2:"11";i:5;s:2:"15";i:6;s:2:"16";i:7;s:2:"18";i:8;s:2:"23";}', '10_icon_c517nqr82g6g1ly28ea7.jpg', '10_icon_c517nqr82g6g1ly28ea7_thumb.jpg', '10_view1_zzd8j91fqvntzo1nfsug.jpg', '10_view1_zzd8j91fqvntzo1nfsug_thumb.jpg', '10_view2_gzw9kuas0ky9kbg4khia.jpg', '10_view2_gzw9kuas0ky9kbg4khia_thumb.jpg', '10_view3_i74bu4yavtq5smddhn6q.jpg', '10_view3_i74bu4yavtq5smddhn6q_thumb.jpg', '10_view4_g4zsffwzwe09lckggjqb.jpg', '10_view4_g4zsffwzwe09lckggjqb_thumb.jpg', '', '', 1, 3998, 1),
(23, 12, 'Single Room', '<p>This room is smaller in size, comfort as standard rooms. can accommodate a maximum of 1 person. (single bed). The rooms are located at the six floor of the hotel and have completely renovated featuring modern decor and design. Single rooms are equipped with tea &amp; coffee making facilities and a fridge. Free WiFi and wired internet.</p>', '<p>This room is smaller in size, comfort as standard rooms. can accommodate a maximum of 1 person. (single bed). The rooms are located at the six floor of the hotel and have completely renovated featuring modern decor and design. Single rooms are equipped with tea &amp; coffee making facilities and a fridge. Free WiFi and wired internet. Very nice and guest-friendly room.</p>', 1, 1, 0, 0, '56.00', '0.00', 0, '0.00', '0.00', '0.00', 0, '0.00', '0.00', '0.00', 0, '0.00', 1, 1, 1, '24.0', 'a:8:{i:0;s:1:"1";i:1;s:1:"3";i:2;s:2:"10";i:3;s:2:"11";i:4;s:2:"12";i:5;s:2:"16";i:6;s:2:"18";i:7;s:2:"22";}', '12_icon_vkkrccma5nnob1fnnvb0.jpg', '12_icon_vkkrccma5nnob1fnnvb0_thumb.jpg', '12_view1_zmg0lx81o2mhl80xjw9n.jpg', '12_view1_zmg0lx81o2mhl80xjw9n_thumb.jpg', '12_view2_ovcvvrijntsmg0v2733u.jpg', '12_view2_ovcvvrijntsmg0v2733u_thumb.jpg', '12_view3_cpcpwmnfiv43qfxm8g7v.jpg', '12_view3_cpcpwmnfiv43qfxm8g7v_thumb.jpg', '12_view4_hyhr9csffv0jkm9h0vwr.jpg', '12_view4_hyhr9csffv0jkm9h0vwr_thumb.jpg', '', '', 0, 4838, 1),
(24, 11, 'Suite', '<p>Each Suite room includes one double bed, bedlinnen, 2 LCD TV''s with satellite cable channels and remote control, fully stocked mini-bar, IDD telephone, towels, shower gels, soap and shampoo. Shower and bathtub.</p>', '<p>Each Suite room includes one double bed, bedlinnen, 2 LCD TV''s with satellite cable channels and remote control, fully stocked mini-bar, IDD telephone, towels, shower gels, soap and shampoo. Shower and bathtub.   <br /><br /> One TV is located in the bedroom, the other one in the dining/living room. There is also a kitchenette, dining table with three chairs, and you can use the Hair Dryer, and inroom safe free of charge, and each of our rooms offer two bottles of water free of charge with a water heating machine and tea and coffee assortment.   <br /><br /> WIFI is available in the room at a small fee and a password can be arranged at the lobby. Each room has a room service menu where you can order any dish you like.</p>', 9, 2, 0, 0, '0.00', '0.00', 0, '0.00', '0.00', '0.00', 0, '0.00', '0.00', '0.00', 0, '0.00', 1, 1, 1, '54.0', 'a:9:{i:0;s:1:"3";i:1;s:1:"4";i:2;s:1:"5";i:3;s:1:"6";i:4;s:1:"7";i:5;s:1:"8";i:6;s:2:"10";i:7;s:2:"16";i:8;s:2:"18";}', '11_icon_luck18dl8lxkvkjjvm2l.jpg', '11_icon_luck18dl8lxkvkjjvm2l_thumb.jpg', '11_view1_s1oz8uxc47ek2r52yim6.jpg', '11_view1_s1oz8uxc47ek2r52yim6_thumb.jpg', '11_view2_dkqz50i1wklmkalr6j40.jpg', '11_view2_dkqz50i1wklmkalr6j40_thumb.jpg', '11_view3_titr0yt9gfelz5k5d460.jpg', '11_view3_titr0yt9gfelz5k5d460_thumb.jpg', '11_view4_rqv92h1825gsm0kw9d5o.jpg', '11_view4_rqv92h1825gsm0kw9d5o_thumb.jpg', '', '', 0, 5905, 1),
(25, 11, 'Family Junior Suite', '<p>The ideal suite for enjoying vacations with all the family! Spacious suite measuring 42 m2 with lovely views of the gardens or pool area. All the Family Deluxe Junior Suites come with king size bed or two double beds on request on arrival at the hotel, plus a sofa-bed and a rollaway bed or bunk beds.</p>', '<p>The ideal suite for enjoying vacations with all the family! Spacious suite measuring 42 m2 with lovely views of the gardens or pool area. All the Family Deluxe Junior Suites come with king size bed or two double beds on request on arrival at the hotel, plus a sofa-bed and a rollaway bed or bunk beds. <br /><br /> For greater fun and additional comfort, the suite includes children’s bed linen, a dividing curtain for extra privacy, and the bathroom has special children’s amenities, such as a little step to reach the sink. <br /><br /> All the suites have sliding glass doors which lead onto the private terrace or balcony and allow greater natural light in suites which are ideal for enjoying with all the family.</p>', 22, 3, 1, 1, '89.00', '24.00', 0, '0.00', '0.00', '0.00', 0, '0.00', '0.00', '0.00', 0, '0.00', 1, 2, 1, '75.0', 'a:10:{i:0;s:1:"4";i:1;s:1:"5";i:2;s:1:"8";i:3;s:2:"10";i:4;s:2:"11";i:5;s:2:"12";i:6;s:2:"13";i:7;s:2:"14";i:8;s:2:"15";i:9;s:2:"18";}', '11_icon_tjpb0m19zp2pfhh4yz7i.jpg', '11_icon_tjpb0m19zp2pfhh4yz7i_thumb.jpg', '11_view1_i8l7fi33epb691ginhrn.jpg', '11_view1_i8l7fi33epb691ginhrn_thumb.jpg', '11_view2_esdm0vp8uwq74bdjufm0.jpg', '11_view2_esdm0vp8uwq74bdjufm0_thumb.jpg', '11_view3_dxeeyvwmcn0jgm7qiwyc.jpg', '11_view3_dxeeyvwmcn0jgm7qiwyc_thumb.jpg', '11_view4_uojw1xfuc25iziwyeskr.jpg', '11_view4_uojw1xfuc25iziwyeskr_thumb.jpg', '', '', 1, 12557, 1),
(26, 12, 'Standard Twin Room', '<p>Enjoy in the view of our city Square that will inspire you to start a new adventure. No matter if you are business or tourist traveler this accommodation will settle all your needs. Standard Twin Room features two single beds, work desk with high-speed internet, LCD TV, mini bar and safe box. The bathroom has Jacuzzi bathtub with superb equipment and exclusive amenities.</p>', '<p>Enjoy in the view of our city Square that will inspire you to start a new adventure. No matter if you are business or tourist traveler this accommodation will settle all your needs. Standard Twin Room features two single beds, work desk with high-speed internet, LCD TV, mini bar and safe box. The bathroom has Jacuzzi bathtub with superb equipment and exclusive amenities.</p>', 20, 2, 0, 0, '68.00', '0.00', 0, '0.00', '0.00', '0.00', 0, '0.00', '0.00', '0.00', 0, '0.00', 1, 1, 1, '45.0', 'a:7:{i:0;s:1:"4";i:1;s:1:"5";i:2;s:2:"10";i:3;s:2:"12";i:4;s:2:"13";i:5;s:2:"14";i:6;s:2:"15";}', '12_icon_zm2levanptfkscbrn38m.jpg', '12_icon_zm2levanptfkscbrn38m_thumb.jpg', '12_view1_o7l89yqep6noso07kjta.jpg', '12_view1_o7l89yqep6noso07kjta_thumb.jpg', '12_view2_j0v6l8x005wtbi1jgry7.jpg', '12_view2_j0v6l8x005wtbi1jgry7_thumb.jpg', '12_view3_x0uomq9qmy6xn9lz7ar6.jpg', '12_view3_x0uomq9qmy6xn9lz7ar6_thumb.jpg', '12_view4_k1uunmk3tidqr8eeym5k.jpg', '12_view4_k1uunmk3tidqr8eeym5k_thumb.jpg', '12_view5_ketn9os24xshzha25nwn.jpg', '12_view5_ketn9os24xshzha25nwn_thumb.jpg', 0, 5514, 1),
(27, 13, 'Suite with City View', '<p>Enjoy a luxury  hotel with our standard living space and elegance fit with floor-to-ceiling city views of the skyline and surrounding mountains. Relax on your luxurious sofa or entertain in your modern dining room. Show off your culinary skills in your European-style kitchen with top-notch appliances. Do it all during the best hotel stay you will ever have.</p>', '<p>Enjoy a luxury  hotel with our standard living space and elegance fit with floor-to-ceiling city views of the skyline and surrounding mountains. Relax on your luxurious sofa or entertain in your modern dining room. Show off your culinary skills in your European-style kitchen with top-notch appliances. Do it all during the best hotel stay you will ever have.</p>', 19, 2, 1, 0, '89.00', '35.00', 0, '0.00', '0.00', '0.00', 0, '0.00', '0.00', '0.00', 0, '0.00', 1, 1, 1, '55.0', 'a:10:{i:0;s:1:"1";i:1;s:1:"3";i:2;s:1:"6";i:3;s:1:"7";i:4;s:2:"12";i:5;s:2:"16";i:6;s:2:"17";i:7;s:2:"18";i:8;s:2:"19";i:9;s:2:"23";}', '13_icon_fdfbojv1alumu5800b6d.jpg', '13_icon_fdfbojv1alumu5800b6d_thumb.jpg', '13_view1_sq3fsbpknf3gxgfavpvt.jpg', '13_view1_sq3fsbpknf3gxgfavpvt_thumb.jpg', '13_view2_sgejqvc9bju20wg397mv.jpg', '13_view2_sgejqvc9bju20wg397mv_thumb.jpg', '13_view3_pocj6st1ipt879qw546f.jpg', '13_view3_pocj6st1ipt879qw546f_thumb.jpg', '13_view4_rzhxvyz45mzqbcag54hm.jpg', '13_view4_rzhxvyz45mzqbcag54hm_thumb.jpg', '13_view5_xh9hhqz5yjvi57cm1h4h.jpg', '13_view5_xh9hhqz5yjvi57cm1h4h_thumb.jpg', 0, 4827, 1),
(28, 15, 'Standard Double Room with Balcony', '<p>These rooms are located in the wing areas of the hotel and have been charmingly furnished and decorated with attractive colours and offer every comfort with fully fitted tiled or carpeted floors, twin or double beds, balcony, bath / shower / WC. ed rooms are equipped with a third bed (sofa bed).  Standard rooms are equipped with satellite TV &amp; integrated music channel.</p>', '<p>These rooms are located in the wing areas of the hotel and have been charmingly furnished and decorated with attractive colours and offer every comfort with fully fitted tiled or carpeted floors, twin or double beds, balcony, bath / shower / WC. ed rooms are equipped with a third bed (sofa bed).  Standard rooms are equipped with satellite TV &amp; integrated music channel, direct dial telephone, bathrobe &amp; slippers, beach towels, pillow ion, hairdryer, light Mini Bar (at an extra charge), a safe, and manually operated air conditioning which is centrally controlled.</p>', 15, 2, 1, 1, '58.00', '20.00', 0, '0.00', '0.00', '0.00', 0, '0.00', '0.00', '0.00', 0, '0.00', 1, 2, 1, '34.0', 'a:10:{i:0;s:1:"3";i:1;s:1:"4";i:2;s:1:"5";i:3;s:1:"7";i:4;s:1:"9";i:5;s:2:"10";i:6;s:2:"12";i:7;s:2:"13";i:8;s:2:"14";i:9;s:2:"15";}', '15_icon_bm70x41t9c7fw4gov0eq.jpg', '15_icon_bm70x41t9c7fw4gov0eq_thumb.jpg', '15_view1_vlmotvd202o94ds7qzxy.jpg', '15_view1_vlmotvd202o94ds7qzxy_thumb.jpg', '15_view2_n00qxtgq37ywskkmgxop.jpg', '15_view2_n00qxtgq37ywskkmgxop_thumb.jpg', '15_view3_zcy3qq0gq7e0fo1dih4k.jpg', '15_view3_zcy3qq0gq7e0fo1dih4k_thumb.jpg', '15_view4_r3ggn144yrty4r1uiaa9.jpg', '15_view4_r3ggn144yrty4r1uiaa9_thumb.jpg', '', '', 0, 4361, 1),
(29, 13, 'Superior King Room', '<p>The 240 sq ft Superior King is located on the higher floors (11-17) and features king-size, comfy bed with Italian sheets and fluffy down pillows, stunning views through floor-to-ceiling, wall-to-wall windows (that open), a rain shower with natural light and city views, custom bath amenities, cozy robes, free WiFi, seating area with table, a giant plasma TV, an overstocked mini bar, and 24-hour room service.</p>', '<p>The 240 sq ft Superior King is located on the higher floors (11-17) and features king-size, comfy bed with Italian sheets and fluffy down pillows, stunning views through floor-to-ceiling, wall-to-wall windows (that open), a rain shower with natural light and city views, custom bath amenities, cozy robes, free WiFi, seating area with table, a giant plasma TV, an overstocked mini bar, and 24-hour room service.</p>', 20, 7, 1, 1, '109.00', '30.00', 0, '0.00', '0.00', '0.00', 0, '0.00', '0.00', '0.00', 0, '0.00', 1, 2, 1, '77.0', 'a:11:{i:0;s:1:"1";i:1;s:1:"2";i:2;s:1:"4";i:3;s:1:"7";i:4;s:1:"9";i:5;s:2:"10";i:6;s:2:"11";i:7;s:2:"12";i:8;s:2:"14";i:9;s:2:"16";i:10;s:2:"17";}', '13_icon_laf09osva24lw0q617g6.jpg', '13_icon_laf09osva24lw0q617g6_thumb.jpg', '13_view1_h9utwesx80unk0wtypo9.jpg', '13_view1_h9utwesx80unk0wtypo9_thumb.jpg', '13_view2_g1q769yf96he8oip0oec.jpg', '13_view2_g1q769yf96he8oip0oec_thumb.jpg', '13_view3_z3vtu3kuxxo7xec4mbiv.jpg', '13_view3_z3vtu3kuxxo7xec4mbiv_thumb.jpg', '13_view4_lz0oordxgs0fv60p9tj6.jpg', '13_view4_lz0oordxgs0fv60p9tj6_thumb.jpg', '13_view5_t9comos0za5gae5y7iwm.jpg', '13_view5_t9comos0za5gae5y7iwm_thumb.jpg', 1, 5641, 1),
(30, 15, 'Superior Double Room', '<p>The comfortable Superior double rooms are equipped with queen size bed and offer a little more space and comfort on 15m². The rooms face the quiet courtyard and offer additional noise absorbing windows. The rooms are also equipped with a bathroom including shower, comfortable seating, desk and flat screen TV. Upon arrival you will find a bottle of mineral water in your room. Internet can be used via WiFi access (free of charge).</p>', '<p>The comfortable Superior double rooms are equipped with queen size bed and offer a little more space and comfort on 15m². The rooms face the quiet courtyard and offer additional noise absorbing windows. The rooms are also equipped with a bathroom including shower, comfortable seating, desk and flat screen TV. Upon arrival you will find a bottle of mineral water in your room. Internet can be used via WiFi access (free of charge).</p>', 22, 3, 0, 1, '99.00', '0.00', 0, '0.00', '0.00', '0.00', 0, '0.00', '0.00', '0.00', 0, '0.00', 1, 2, 1, '78.0', 'a:10:{i:0;s:1:"1";i:1;s:1:"5";i:2;s:2:"10";i:3;s:2:"11";i:4;s:2:"12";i:5;s:2:"13";i:6;s:2:"14";i:7;s:2:"15";i:8;s:2:"16";i:9;s:2:"21";}', '15_icon_eazqt1vuofxa0l3su304.jpg', '15_icon_eazqt1vuofxa0l3su304_thumb.jpg', '15_view1_jf26qptdlb0rl0hf0day.jpg', '15_view1_jf26qptdlb0rl0hf0day_thumb.jpg', '15_view2_u892tbune4rrisw0iqm5.jpg', '15_view2_u892tbune4rrisw0iqm5_thumb.jpg', '15_view3_bvwo5d4erddjlmlfyf3c.jpg', '15_view3_bvwo5d4erddjlmlfyf3c_thumb.jpg', '15_view4_nu51m1a6rw0ts6hwjlba.jpg', '15_view4_nu51m1a6rw0ts6hwjlba_thumb.jpg', '', '', 0, 4846, 1),
